r-organ self-consistency, mutual best match, margin, leave-one-out robustness.\n4. Write outputs.\n\nOne more thing: in the sample_similarity.csv evidence_type and the evidence string in swap_call.json, mention: promoter accessibility of stomach marker genes (GKN1, CLDN18, CHIA) peaks in the Cloaca column; caudal/cloacal markers (CDX2, CDX4, REG4) + lymphoid genes peak in the Stomach column; mutual best match; genome-wide correlations.\n\nOK, let me now check the additional candidate genes."}}
