stency as evidence (with caveats).\n\nLet me also reconsider Limb more carefully — check which limb markers are driving Gill 0.65. Let me output the Limb set genes' profiles for the Gill column. If it's all fast muscle genes (TNNC2/TNNT3/TNNI2/SCN4A/CASQ1/RYR1/MYH1-3), then the explanation \"gills contain skeletal muscle\" is solid. Let me verify quickly.\n"}}
